<item>
<title>[QA-2888] Intelligent Test Automation Accelerator MVP</title>
<link>https://moduscreate.atlassian.net/browse/QA-2888</link>
<project id="11519" key="QA">Quality Assurance Department</project>
<description><ul> <li>Build the Phase 1 MVP of the Intelligent Test Automation Accelerator using Playwright and Amazon Q Developer, with BrowserStack and CI/CD integration, to establish a reusable QE foundation for internal enablement and future client-facing offerings.</li> <li>Create an initial, reusable automation accelerator that demonstrates AI-assisted test automation workflows using <b>Amazon Q Developer</b> and <b>Playwright</b>, with <b>cross-browser/device execution via BrowserStack</b> and <b>automated execution through CI/CD</b>.</li> <li>The MVP should include a base framework, a defined repository structure, reusable prompt-driven workflows, sample UI/API automated tests, execution setup, and supporting documentation so the solution can be reused across QE initiatives and expanded in later phases.</li> <li>This epic focuses on delivering the foundational implementation needed to validate the approach and enable future scaling. The broader proposal includes additional capabilities such as expanded observability, training assets, partner integrations, and client-facing collateral, which should be treated as later-phase backlog items.</li> </ul> <p>~120 hours</p></description>
